Subject: [PATCH 151/159] [ae-patch] Let an extension open the Azure cost
 analysis page

The Admin Center's Azure spend card offers Open Cost Management, which the navigation.openExternal allowlist refused. isAeAzureCostLinkUrl in lib/aeExternalUrls.ts admits exactly one URL, the portal's cost analysis page, as a whole-string match. It names no subscription, so the link reveals nothing.
